{"id":"1044982057791881222","date":1537978112000,"rawContent":"Every day is a good day to be working with the @SREcoalition to create systemic change in the Jewish community wrt #MeToo-related issues, but today feels like an especially good day to be checking in with my Steering Committee peeps.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":49,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045131475841159169","date":1538013736000,"rawContent":"Hey, @Hannah_Dreyfus wrote about the #metoo Al Chet that I wrote in collaboration with @GuilaBen @sbearbergman @leahgreenblum Shia Berkovits, Emily Becker and Abby Citrin: https:\/\/t.co\/DwcSjcXoOn cc @avitalrachel","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":50,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":17.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045381567881891840","date":1538073362000,"rawContent":"\"This Sukkot we cannot ignore that we do not all sit under the sky equally sheltered. As I hear the stories of people learning that their bodies are not protected... I reencounter my own stories.\"  https:\/\/t.co\/OEHBJUcUsc  #MeToo  #BelieveSurvivors","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":51,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":18.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045408165360226304","date":1538079704000,"rawContent":"Lot of people this week seem to be not just triggered, but also remembering other things that they had shoved in a box that stayed closed even during #metoo last year.  \n\nI see you.  I believe you. I am holding you in my heart.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":52,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":19.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045417572156485632","date":1538081946000,"rawContent":"\u201cAnger is a reprehensible quality\u2014but when employed to correct or to reprove, or because of indignation at the performance of transgressions, it becomes laudable.\u201d  Ibn Gabriol, 11thc.  #MeToo #BelieveSurvivors","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":53,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1045486643564748800","date":1538098414000,"rawContent":"@NEWFLYG #metoo was started by a Black woman, @TaranaBurke.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1046453251951001600","date":1538328872000,"rawContent":"This is a story about power. Many #metoo stories are. Potiphar\u2019s wife\u2019s lies were believed not because she was a woman, but because she was wealthy, had the right national status, was married to someone with power, etc. Also why she demanded in the first place.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":20.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1046460683930488840","date":1538330644000,"rawContent":"#Metoo never said that women never ever abuse or exploit or sexually harass or rape. But look at the story of Potiphar\u2019s wife and the examples mentioned in the above tweet and not surprisingly, it\u2019s pretty clear where power is held in each of these cases.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":56,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":21.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1046460690913996803","date":1538330645000,"rawContent":"Systemically, men hold power. But that\u2019s not true in every case. (And yes, there are #metoo stories not about the abuse of power. But a lot of them are.)","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":57,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":22.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1046462711348056064","date":1538331127000,"rawContent":"Ok. But I\u2019m gonna have to talk about Esther too. \n\nAnother Biblical #metoo \n\nTHREAD","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":58,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1046472370582638597","date":1538333430000,"rawContent":"As long as I did two Biblical #metoo threads today, figured I should haul this one out of the archives as well:","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":59,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1047323305336815617","date":1538536308000,"rawContent":"ICYMI it's the abuse of power, stupid.  #MeToo","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":60,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1047912687865352192","date":1538676828000,"rawContent":"Male #MeToo non-victim allies: Please speak out, please speak up. And please also figure out ways that you can sometimes hand over your mic and platform and access to women.  Nothing will ever change until the seat of power and authority changes.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":61,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1047974050117705728","date":1538691458000,"rawContent":"Feeling a little rage-y today? I have some self-care tips for you.  #MeToo #StopKavanaugh \n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/l6h0j0Okwm","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":26.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":62,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":26.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050002967091433473","date":1539175190000,"rawContent":"What are things that you wish male non-survivor allies would keep in mind or do when they\u2019re speaking about #metoo? Concrete, specific tips. \n\nIf you are a male non-survivor ally, maybe this is a thread for you to read and not one to contribute to. That\u2019s actually important work.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":63,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1050342244409061376","date":1539256080000,"rawContent":"@itsandrewgrace @Nick_Offerman A man. \n\nWho himself has not been sexually victimized. \n\nWho is trying to be a good ally to women (who pretty much all have some #metoo story, usually many, whether harassment or assault or etc) and survivors of sexual victimization of other genders.","media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"s